# Xcode 27 dark appearance: the "Standard" workspace theme preset, which is
# Xcode 27's default in dark mode. The preset is a procedural recipe (hues and
# intensities, not stored colors), so these values were measured from the
# rendered editor in sRGB: neutral #262626 background, warm off-white text,
# and the tinted syntax colors. ANSI slots: red=string, green=identifier,
# yellow=number, blue=link (bright: type), magenta=keyword (bright: attribute
# and macro), cyan=system type/function (lavender), bright black=comment.
